{"data": [{"author_id": "2806523453", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:16:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115930807340593471"], "id": "2115930807340593471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115820236981092502", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "**Top 5 aus deiner Sicht (Abundance-Kette):**\n\n1. **SpaceX**  \n   Mass to Orbit, Orbital-Compute, Energie-Infrastruktur im All. Der Engpass, der alles andere skaliert (1,7 GW → 13 GW und darüber hinaus). Eigentum an der Maschine, nicht nur an den Coupons.\n\n2. **Tesla** https://t.co/FRYdGV1CFY", "url": "https://x.com/BitcoinisLove3/status/2115930807340593471"}, {"author_id": "1979288764313931779", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:05:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115912940465569842"], "id": "2115912940465569842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 47, "impression_count": 23484, "like_count": 122, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Had lunch with a few engineers in the Bay Area today, and we had a lengthy discussion about the semiconductor supply outlook for 2027 and 2028.\n\nThe expectation was that supply constraints would persist across advanced and legacy node wafers, HBM and DRAM, package substrates,", "url": "https://x.com/damnang2/status/2115912940465569842"}, {"author_id": "945557653303934976", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:58:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115941486017868284"], "id": "2115941486017868284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 684, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 日本株 寄り付き前ダイジェスト📊\n \n✅ 日本株（先物/プレ）: \n日経先物 -0.95% (64,125円)キオクシア -9.55%、\nソフトバンクG -2.89% \nと全面安スタートへ、\n✅ 米国半導体（夜間）: 暴落。半導体3倍 -14.47%、\nARM -7.55%、\nSKハイニックス -5.35%、TSMC -3.17%、\n✅ AI関連: \nエヌビディア", "url": "https://x.com/kimura08065/status/2115941486017868284"}, {"author_id": "174073808", "cr