and Capex"}, "author_id": "849661480869912576", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:17:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115931146756485311"], "id": "2115931146756485311", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1833, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/zucbciX1tL", "url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2115931146756485311"}, {"author_id": "1972217192235388929", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:55:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115910504585875485"], "id": "2115910504585875485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2020, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115906098557534251", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "10/30 朝の🇺🇸米国株まとめ(ꆧ⩊ꆧ )\n.*·.⟡┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·*.\nおはぎゃ…(((;°Д°;))))ｷﾞｬｰｯ‼️\n米ハイテクに逆風‼️🇺🇸📉\n\nGoogle大幅安⤵️\n決算後のAmazon・Intelも急落⤵️\n半導体にも厳しい朝です🥶🥶🥶\n.*·.⟡┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·*.\n※通常取引と時間外を分けて記載。 https://t.co/VMtenX6jHT https://t.co/bhjRwlQhLG", "url": "https://x.com/totono_ieie/status/2115910504585875485"}, {"author_id": "924358316", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:20:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115916585038971353"], "id": "2115916585038971353", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "主线更新｜技术进展：日月光要把 AMD 服务器 CPU Venice 放到方形面板上封装，SemiAnalysis 称 2027 年一季度小规模投产。第一步提升不大，一块面板只比一片圆晶圆多做 14% 的封装。\n提升小，是因为晶圆的边缘放不下大方块，芯片越大，换成面板越划算。Venice 不算大；芯片要是做到接近下一代巨型 AI", "url": "https://x.com/molslamb/status/2115916585038971353"}, {"author_id": "924358316", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115924134274154734"], "id": "2115924134274154734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "主线更新｜AI 物理化：台积电自己买面板厂了，但这批厂房赶不上 2027 年 AI 芯片封装（CoWoS）的缺口。\n\n工商时报 10/29 报道，台积电多次去友达中科厂做尽职调查，先谈两座，另两座可能拿到优先承购权，交易还要等友达董事会通过。", "url": "https://x.com/molslamb/status/2115924134274154734"}, {"author_id": "1962246440975052800", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:41:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115937018660139419"], "id": "2115937018660139419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$TSM gets confirmation as UMC utilization tops 90% in 2H26. WFE heading from 129B to ~220B by 2031 concentrates every incremental leading-edge dollar at the foundry owning 2nm and CoWoS.", "url": "https://x.com/quantumboomnow/status/2115937018660139419"}, {"author_id": "2099646831311585280", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:12:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115914595236028836"], "id": "2115914595236028836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Besi's chief executive says ASML is not a rival in chip bonding. The report that scared investors cut the stock 13%, but ASML has confirmed nothing and Besi just booked record orders.\n\nhttps://t.co/yvLe7Zze8s https://t.co/BwL28NX2mY", "url": "https://x.com/inference_org/status/2115914595236028836"}, {"author_id": "1373569238061912069", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:03:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115927557971509507"], "id": "2115927557971509507", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5020, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AIトレンドニュース要点（CTEE記事）\n詳細は該当するCTEE抽出記事Noを参照のこと\n\n本ポストでは重要部の強調は割愛。\n\nI. AI投資の評価軸は、支出規模から収益・現金流への転換に\n\nAI関連の受注拡大が続く一方、市場は投資額に対応する収益・現金流を厳しく確認し始めている。", "url": "https://x.com/Nikola_pn2501/status/2115927557971509507"}, {"author_id": "3078292462", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115926656552431640"], "id": "2115926656552431640", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count